te 0 (borderline):** it orders every 2 days at about 1.1× the forecast. It saves about 250 in daily order fees. But it carries about half a day's extra stock, which costs roughly 500 in storage. It probably ends up slightly below the best daily plans.\n- **Candidates 3 and 6 (strong):** product 0 at about 1.05× and product 1 at about 1.14×, close to the best levels. Candidate 6 is the same plan but orders less in the last few days, and leftover stock is worth nothing at the end, so it gets a slight edge.\n- **Candidate 4 (borderline):** product 0 is right at the forecast, which is good. Product 1 is only about 1.03×, so it under-orders the product where shortages are expensive.\n- **Candidate 5 (borderline):** product 1 at about 1.3× is somewhat too much, and the excess spoils."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5042, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5042}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:40:42.566Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWEBo4S9uSjTfdSnHKhu"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01TNsSiUeaWLgfu18BmCUrjA", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWEBoM3p4dM4ZwWNSiVn", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01TNsSiUeaWLgfu18BmCUrjA", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.45, 0.05, 0.2, 0.8, 0