Plan 2 looks weak.** It orders about 40% extra of both products. For product 0, around 300 surplus units spoil at 12 each, roughly 3,600 lost.\n6. **Plan 7 looks weak.** It orders every third day in large batches. Around day 17 stock should exceed the 224-unit warehouse limit, and the excess is lost. It also pays a lot for storage.\n7. **Plan 1 is the worst.** It never orders product 0, so it gives up that product's margin and pays a penalty on nearly all of its demand."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5060, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5060}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:41:11.445Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWEDimXRUDpWniB3FGDp"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_015KGLJF3ShMt9okSivAM9Fi", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWEDj1uCVrjeqMVNnkLw", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_015KGLJF3ShMt9okSivAM9Fi", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.6, 0.03, 0.12, 0.85, 0.4, 0.55, 0.88, 0.07]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5060, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tok